      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Backroom staff",
          "heading": "France fitness coach Gaëtan Boissard tasked with keeping Bleus fresh for Argentina",
          "body": "Today's test against Argentina comes a week after the 21-19 win over South Africa, and Rugbyrama casts recovery as a major issue for bodies put through the wringer. That job falls to France fitness coach Gaëtan Boissard. The Burgundian, whose father coached amateur sides, worked with France U20 when the 1999 generation won the Six Nations and the World Cup in France. The FFR then handed him a fitness contract in 2018."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
