          "kicker": "Camp visitor",
          "heading": "Justin Tipuric visits Wales camp but cannot talk Tandy into playing",
          "body": "Ospreys coach Justin Tipuric spent Wednesday with Wales at their Vale Resort training base, days after the 35-28 win over New Zealand. He told WalesOnline he had tried to persuade head coach Steve Tandy, his former Ospreys team-mate and coach, to play again. \"I tried to get him to play, but he didn't fancy it,\" said the three-time Lions tourist. He recalled Tandy, then of Neath, tripping him before a ruck in one of his first games for Aberavon. Tandy, preparing for Australia, says Wales run an open environment for club coaches."
        },
